urrents of furnace-like heat.\n\t\tIf you have a gem or mindstar in your psionically wielded slot, this will do %0.1f Fire damage to all adjacent enemies, costing %0.1f energy per creature. \n\t\tIf you have a conventional weapon in your psionically wielded slot, this will add %0.1f Fire damage to all your weapon hits, costing %0.1f energy per hit.\n\t\tWhen deactivated, if you have at least %d energy, a massive spike of thermal energy is released as a conical blast (radius %d) of superheated air. Anybody caught in it will suffer up to %d fire damage over several turns.\n\t\t#{bold}#Activating the aura takes no time but de-activating it does.#{normal}#\n\t\tTo turn off an aura without spiking it, deactivate it and target yourself. The damage will improve with your Mindpower.\n\t\tYou can only have two of these auras active at once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将你周围的空气充满火炉般的热量。\n\t\t如果你的灵能武器槽佩戴的是宝石或灵晶，会对所有相邻的敌人造成 %0.1f 的火焰伤害，每个生物消耗 %0.1f 能量。\n\t\t如果你的灵能武器槽佩戴的是武器，每次武器命中时附加 %0.1f 的火焰伤害，每次命中消耗 %0.1f 能量。\n\t\t当关闭该技能时，如果你拥有最少 %d 点能量，巨大的热能会释放为一个半径为 %d 的锥形冲击。范围内的任意目标在数轮中受到高达 %d 的火焰伤害。\n\t\t#{bold}#激活光环是不消耗时间的，但是关闭它则需要消耗时间。#{normal}#\n\t\t若要关闭光环而不释放热能冲击，请在关闭时以自己为目标。伤害随着精神强度而增长。\n\t\t你同时只能激活两种此类光环。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6aa0862855fa43f31322aff38bc91750c0773fbb1644f290971b8880ecf77689","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6c20950251ef7c3e04729c3c3296e9da897e5bdb416a4fca755e8c11ee9a6a2","logical_entry_identity":"3d26f04327e83abbdbeafad392258bbd749d7c3d40edfde83648aac9a8acbdb5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"infusion store","source_tag":"entity name","target":"纹身店"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"116f455d2bc39968288d1431f3da63fab7d3ced9211bc2eec786d8776d9c04ae","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"f6c86d4f03d70369ad0b39525f022455434b1fd3da1d779e0702f560c196addd","logical_entry_identity":"45417c890f1db486936caf576c41446421b1d1e2201ba51e69abe40344c6df86","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Increases attack speed by %d%%